    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_EveryoneGoesOnAdventures",
      "en_US": [
        "Everyone goes off on adventures,\n",
        "and then they gradually grow up..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_WildPokemonAttack",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s true that wild Pokémon do attack\n",
        "people sometimes...\r",
        "But, Pokémon also open their hearts\n",
        "to you, so you can become friends."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_YouLookGoodTogether",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh! A Pokémon!\n",
        "You look good together!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_HelpingPutTogetherPokedex",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, you’re helping put together\n",
        "a Pokédex?\r",
        "That means you’re going to travel\n",
        "all over the place with Pokémon!\r",
        "That sounds like a lot of fun!\n",
        "I’m a little envious, to be honest!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTown_Text_TechnologyBlowsMeAway",
      "en_US": [
        "Technology just blows me away!\r",
        "I mean, now you can play with people\n",
        "around the world...wirelessly!"
      ]
